            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "So it is about Deputy Minister Yu after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Are you truly so eager to deal with your predecessor, Deputy Minister Lin Qingyan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "This, too, is the Department of Discipline and Supervision Censorate's responsibility. Perhaps you are being too negligent with this matter, Monitor Censor Jie Zhen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_040"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "This is precisely why I summoned you two here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "The Department of Discipline and Supervision monitors a variety of officials among its ranks. Though the man in question has since resigned and returned to his home, he must be held liable for the transgressions he committed during his tenure."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "This has much to do with Deputy Minister Yu Cheng's fabrication of evidence during the impeachment of Langyi's magistrate all those years ago, and though you two have already discussed this matter for many times, we have yet to reach a conclusion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "In roughly two hours, Deputy Minister Yu Cheng will arrive in this place..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "You summoned him here behind my back?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Such is Taihe."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_040"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "We can ill afford to wait any longer. Regardless of how this is resolved, the two of you must arrive at a conclusion in these two scant hours."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "If he will be brought to justice, then we three shall hear this case here in the courts' stead to uphold the law of Great Yan."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "If we instead turn a blind eye, then I ask you to keep your distance when Deputy Minister Yu arrives and let us catch up on old times."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "These hills are less than twenty li from the capital. The moment he enters the city, there will be no more room to turn the situation around."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
