            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "As I've always said, you truly are unreasonable."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "I've said this many times as well. Deputy Minister Lin Qingyan merely does what the Deputy Minister of the Central Judicial Office Assistant must."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Ten years ago, when Deputy Minister Yu inspected the nation's many prisons, he passed by Langyi and indicted the local magistrate. After a year and three months, the magistrate died in prison."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "And I discovered certain discrepancies while going over the literature."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Three months ago, I visited Langyi and looked into the matter... The key evidence that Deputy Minister Yu used during the impeachment, such as the account book and directory of personnel were all indeed fabricated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "The evidence I have gathered is conclusive, irrefutable."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "I don't mean to refute this old case, no."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "I just mean to ask... Do you think the magistrate did not deserve his impeachment?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Is it not the truth that during his years in the position, he deceived the entire institution from top to bottom, appropriating great sums of the royal court's wealth?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Is it not also indisputable, nay, irrefutable that he repeatedly misused his position and issued local decrees to levy new taxes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "How long did he block the appeals of subjects demanding redress for their injustices, bribe government inspectors and officials, falsify the sentiment of the populace in his reports to the capital, causing immeasurable harm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Of the dozens of charges he was impeached upon, was there a single one that was fabricated?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "They were all true."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_040"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "If Deputy Minister Yu had implicated a good man, we would not be discussing the matter."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "The impeachment of the Langyi magistrate also implicated some dozen mandarins in the Langyi and capital governments, as well as the inspectorate. The ensuing investigations showed all were guilty as charged. The news shook the court, struck the provinces with astonishment, and improved social ethos for the better."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "From what I have heard, letters of appreciation from the masses arrived to the Central Judicial Office and the Department of Discipline and Supervision in tall piles."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "From a bystander's point of view, was the impeachment somehow not satisfactory to the citizenry?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Put another way, Deputy Minister Yu's actions were to the benefit of the masses, were they not?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Taihe, what do you think?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_040"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "I agree."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Furthermore, it would seem that you have misunderstood me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "I never said I would not handle this matter."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "By handle, you mean...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "The Judicial Review Office will remove Yu Cheng's name from the Haoran Pavilion. The Ministry of Revenue will confiscate his retirement, and the benefits he enjoyed after returning to his hometown will be cancelled."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Furthermore, should Yu Cheng's relatives apply for official posts in the future, the court will take this into consideration."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "At the same time, all officials of the Ministry of Justice, the Department of Discipline and Supervision, and the Central Judicial Office must, regardless of their rank, take his case as a warning."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "And if Yu Cheng is truly a treacherous villain, before we send him to prison, I will first torture him with my string."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "But he dedicated his entire life to his duties. He is a good official, and he is almost seventy years of age. Can we not grant him a smooth, peaceful retirement, at the very least?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "You wish to keep this under wraps and minimize his punishment for such a major transgression... His crimes would go unpunished and hidden from all under Heaven. How is this 'the very least?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Taihe, what say you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_040",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "You agree...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Taihe, I know what kind of man you are. You always distinguish right from wrong, and you handle all official business impartially. Never have I seen you hem and haw so much. It's why you were able to become Monitor Censor so soon after you retired from the military."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "But why so hesitant this time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_040",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "You flatter me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "To tell the truth..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "Ranks and perspectives aside for the moment, I have nothing but admiration for what Deputy Minister Yu did at the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "The magistrate was infamous for his conduct. Though Langyi saw many challenge his rule over the years, none prevailed before him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "The magistrate kept his deeds clandestine and concealed. He was a deviously cunning man, and he had just about everyone in his pocket. If he had any other choice, Deputy Minister Yu would not have resorted to such methods."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "To solve that case, he put his own personal wealth and life on the line."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "Someone so honorable and upright... with such immense bravery, willing to brave even death... He is no less a man than my comrades on the battlefield."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_040",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "This is why I have no choice but to ask the two of you to make this decision."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jie Zhen",
        "text": "Taihe, to be frank, I admire your gentle sentiments."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "I, too, admire Deputy Minister Yu's character."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan",
        "text": "Do you see that tree ahead of us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
